035176*    PERFORM DISPLAY-SIOAPL-ENT THRU FIN-DISPLAY-SIOAPL-ENT.      BUG23454
      *           
           CALL  'GRCONSIO'  USING  DLMT-INFO-BLOCK
                                    INPUT-AREA
                                    DLMT-WORK-AREA
                                    DLMT-OUTPUT-AREA
                                    DLMT-SAVE-DATA
                                    AREA-GR-RUTSIO.
      *                             
035176*    PERFORM DISPLAY-SIOAPL-SAL THRU FIN-DISPLAY-SIOAPL-SAL.      BUG23454
      *
       FIN-CALL-GRCONSIO.
           EXIT.
           
